    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="34">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 34</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hwa folces fyrdscip awyrde, gebete þæt georne ⁊ cyninge þa munde; ⁊ gif hit man amyrre þæt hit ænote weorðe, forgylde hit fullice ⁊ cyninge þone mundbrice.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone damages a national warship, he shall with all diligence make compensation for it, and shall pay to the king the fine due for breach of his "mund", and if it be destroyed so as to be useless, he shall pay for it in full, and give the king the fine due for breach of his "mund".</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
